                    "startIndex": 62,
                    "endIndex": 380,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Recommended order: office dressing, repeat wear, then travel. These topics connect current search-result patterns with Cottonworld’s calm, practical approach to everyday life. Search presence and editorial coverage indicate opportunity; they do not prove growing India-wide search volume, competitor traffic or sales.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
