                  {
                    "startIndex": 380,
                    "endIndex": 464,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "1. Hot Commute, Cold Office: What to Wear for Both Without Carrying a Second Outfit\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "headingId": "h.e98csf7h4q0o",
                  "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 464,
              "endIndex": 790,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 464,
                    "endIndex": 790,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Why this topic: Indian workwear results repeatedly address humidity, commuting and aggressive air conditioning. Haus of Handmade’s office-wear guide covers that exact tension; Sigma Code focuses on keeping linen presentable at work. The opportunity is a practical whole-day system, rather than another list of office outfits.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 790,
              "endIndex": 1122,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 790,
                    "endIndex": 1122,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Distinctive angle: Follow one working day—commute, desk, meeting and journey home. Show a breathable base plus a removable layer, with examples for men and women. Address seated comfort, dress codes, transparency and realistic creasing. Treat rainy-day drying separately; do not promise sweat-proof or wrinkle-free natural fabrics.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 1122,
              "endIndex": 1380,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 1122,
                    "endIndex": 1380,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Search targets: “what to wear in a cold office in summer”; “breathable office wear India”; “linen office outfits”. Proposed intent: informational with a clear shopping next step. Priority: first. Confidence: medium-high on relevance; demand size unverified.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
