            },
            {
              "startIndex": 3121,
              "endIndex": 3445,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 3121,
                    "endIndex": 3445,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Why this topic: Current results include both five-day cabin-bag checklists and India-specific travel outfit guides. WNTR uses a packing list and checklist format; Zero Label organises advice around destinations and a clothing capsule. The opportunity is to combine a usable itinerary with honest natural-fabric care advice.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 3445,
              "endIndex": 3825,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 3445,
                    "endIndex": 3825,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Distinctive angle: Plan outfits for transit, walking, a relaxed dinner and repeat wear. Show which items do two jobs, where an extra clean top matters, and how to plan around laundry access, humidity and linen creasing. Include a compact day-by-day outfit grid. Test the final packing list with actual items; do not promise a particular bag weight or universal airline allowance.\n",
                      "textStyle": {}
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "paragraphStyle": {
                  "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                  "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "startIndex": 3825,
              "endIndex": 4092,
              "paragraph": {
                "elements": [
                  {
                    "startIndex": 3825,
                    "endIndex": 4092,
                    "textRun": {
                      "content": "Search targets: “5 day trip packing list”; “travel capsule wardrobe India”; “cotton linen travel outfits”. Proposed intent: practical planning with shopping relevance. Priority: third. Confidence: medium; current coverage is verified, growth in search demand is not.\n",
